X-WR-CALNAME:Elizabeth line disruption
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-08-16T03:30:00&endDate=2026-08-16T08:00:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nELIZABETH LINE: Sunday 16 August\, until 0900\, no service between West Drayton and Slough. Replacement bus service W1 operates between Hayes & Harlington and Slough via West Drayton and Langley. Buses will not call at Iver. In addition\, GWR trains at 0001 and 0049 from Paddington to Reading and at 0021 from Reading to Paddington will not call at Burnham and Taplow. Connecting replacement buses operate between Slough\, Burnham and Taplow.
DTEND:20260816T080000Z
DTSTART:20260816T033000Z
SUMMARY:Elizabeth line: Part Closure
UID:61e93984-c5d1-4bf9-8418-33334bd25629@61e9.org
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-08-23T03:30:00&endDate=2026-08-23T07:00:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nELIZABETH LINE: Sunday 23 August\, until 0800\, no service between West Drayton and Maidenhead. Replacement bus service W1 operates between Hayes & Harlington and Slough via West Drayton and Langley. Buses will not call at Iver. Replacement bus service W3 operates between Slough and Maidenhead via Burnham and Taplow
DTEND:20260823T070000Z
DTSTART:20260823T033000Z
SUMMARY:Elizabeth line: Part Closure
